ft responsivegov engGov\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.gov.hk/en/residents/\" class=\"homePageURL\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"/gia/images/govLink_tc.png\" class=\"hdrLnk b0\" id=\"hdrGovLnk\" alt=\"GovHK\" title=\"GovHK\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/gia/general/202611/03/P2026110300273.htm\"><img src=\"/gia/images/lang_tc.png\" class=\"hdrLnk b0\" id=\"hdrTCLnk\" alt=\"繁體版\" title=\"繁體版\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"http://sc.isd.gov.hk/TuniS//www.info.gov.hk/gia/general/202611/03/P2026110300273.htm\" class=\"govEnd engGovEnd\"><img src=\"/gia/images/lang_sc.png\" class=\"hdrLnk b0\" id=\"hdrSCLnk\" alt=\"简体版\" title=\"简体版\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<!--div id=\"testing\" style=\"position:absolute;color:red;font:arial;font-size:25pt;left:390px;bottom:30px;font-weight:bold;\">[Testing]</div-->\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n\n<div id=\"headerBanner\" style=\"width:100%;height:50px;\">\n  <div class=\"wrapper\" style=\"max-width:963px;width:100%;height:50px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"contentBody\" class=\"row\" style=\"max-width:947px;width:100%;height:auto;\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"colLeft resLeftContent\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"row\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"rel\" style=\"margin-top:-10px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-12\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"includedContent\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"left\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<INPUT TYPE=submit class=\"submitBtnSmall\" name=submit value=\"GO\" onclick=\"handleSelect();return false;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"sharePost2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"javascript:shareFacebook()\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_facebook\" title=\"Share on Facebook\" alt=\"Share on Facebook\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"javascript:shareGooglePlus()\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_google_plus\" title=\"Share on Google Plus\" alt=\"Share on Google Plus\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"javascript:shareTwitter()\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_twitter\" title=\"Share on X\" alt=\"Share on X\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"MAILTO:?subject=Press%20Release%20%3A%20Land%20Registry%20releases%20statistics%20for%20October&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.info.gov.hk%2Fgia%2Fgeneral%2F202611%2F03%2FP2026110300276.htm\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_mailto\" title=\"Email\" alt=\"Email\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--a href=\"P2026110300276.txt\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_save\" title=\"Right Click to Save\"></a-->\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/cgi-bin/isd/gia/savefile.pl\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_save\" title=\"Save\" alt=\"Save\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"P2026110300276p.htm\" style=\"width:18px;height:16px;\" class=\"icon_print\" title=\"Print\" alt=\"Print\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"rel\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fontSize1\" style=\"display:none\">Land Registry releases statistics for October</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"fontSize1\" id=\"PRHeadline\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<span id=\"PRHeadlineSpan\">Land Registry releases statistics for October</span>\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"starBar\" class=\"fontSize1\">*********************************************</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div id=\"starBarSpacing\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<span id=\"pressrelease\" class=\"fontSize1\">\n\t\t\t\t&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;​The Land Registry today (November 3) released its statistics for October 2026.<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br />\r\nLand registration<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*&nbsp; &nbsp;The number of sale and purchase agreements for all building units received for registration in October was 5 795 (-10.0 per cent compared with September 2026 and -19.4 per cent compared with October 2025)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*&nbsp; &nbsp;The 12-month moving average for October was 7 566 (1.5 per cent below the 12-month moving average for September 2026 but 16.7 per cent above that for October 2025)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*&nbsp; &nbsp;The total consideration for sale and purchase agreements of building units in October was $50.0 billion (-6.5 per cent compared with September 2026 and -13.6 per cent compared with October 2025)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*&nbsp; &nbsp;Among the sale and purchase agreements, 4 512 were for residential units (-5.2 per cent compared with September 2026 and -21.0 per cent compared with October 2025)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*&nbsp; &nbsp;The total consideration for sale and purchase agreements in respect of residential units was $42.3 billion (-9.5 per cent compared with September 2026 and -17.1 per cent compared with October 2025)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Statistics on sales of residential units do not include sale and purchase agreements relating to sales of units under the Home Ownership Scheme, the Private Sector Participation Scheme, the Tenants Purchase Scheme, etc, unless the premium of the unit concerned has been paid after the sale restriction period.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Figures on sale and purchase agreements received for the past 12 months, the year-on-year rate of change and breakdown figures on residential sales have also been released.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;As deeds may not be lodged with the Land Registry until up to 30 days after the transaction, these statistics generally relate to land transactions in the previous month.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLand search<br />\r\n<br />\r\n*&nbsp; &nbsp;The number of searches of land registers made by the public in October was 418 352 (-9.6 per cent compared with September 2026 but +6.6 per cent compared with October 2025)<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The statistics cover searches made at the counter, through the self-service terminals and via the Integrated Registration Information System Online Services.\n\t\t\t\t<br />\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"controlDisplay2 resRightContent\" >\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div>&nbsp;</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mB15 f15\">Ends/Tuesday, November 3, 2026\n\t\t\t\t<br/>\n\t\t\t\t Issued at HKT 15:00\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n\t\t\t\t NNNN\n\t\t\t\t</div>\t \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</span>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"btm_btn\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"left\" style=\"white-space:nowrap;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/gia/ISD_public_Calendar_en.html\" class=\"newAch\">Archives</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/gia/general/202611/02.htm\" class=\"newAch mL5\">Yesterday's Press Releases</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"resContentBackTop\" >\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"display:inline-block;padding-right:10px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/gia/general/202611/03.htm\" class=\"newAch\">Back to Index Page</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"#\" class=\"backTop\">Back to top</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div style=\"padding-top:10px\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/gia/general/today.htm\" class=\"newAch\">Today's Press Releases</a>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t<div class=\"controlDisplay1 resRightContent\">\n\t\t\t<div id=\"rightContent\" class=\"fontSize1\">\n\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t  <h2 class=\"attTypeTitle1\" style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Attachment</h2>\n\t\t\t  <div class=\"mT10 pad10 resAttach\">\n\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t  <a class=\"left\" href=\"https://gia.info.gov.hk/general/202611/03/P2026110300276_557525_1_1793678584832.pdf\" title=\"\"><img width=\"50\" style=\"vertical-align:middle;border:1px solid gray;margin-left:2px;\" src=\"https://gia.info.gov.hk/general/202611/03/P2026110300276_557525_1_1793678584832.pdft\" /></a>\n\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t\t  <div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t  <a href=\"https://gia.info.gov.hk/general/202611/03/P2026110300276_557525_1_1793678584832.pdf\" class=\"attach_text wrap_txt\" style=\"text-align:left;\" title=\"\"><span>Annex</span></a>\n\t\t\t\t  <div style=\"height:8px;\">&nbsp;</div>\t  \n\t\t\t\t  \n\t\t\t  </div>\n\t\t\t  \n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\n</div>\n<div id=\"footer\" style=\"width:100%;height:auto;\">\n\t<div class=\"wrapper\" style=\"max-width:950px;width:100%;height:auto;\">\n\t\t<!--a href=\"/gia/ISD_public_important_notice_en.html\" class=\"left mT10\">Important Notices</a-->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"right\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.webforall.gov.hk/recognition_scheme\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"logo_webforall\" title=\"Web Accessibility Recognition Scheme\" alt=\"Web Accessibility Recognition Scheme\"></a>\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/WAI/WCAG2AA-Conformance\" rel=\"external\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"logo_wcag\" title=\"Level Double-A conformance, W3C WAI Web Content Accessibility Guidelines 2.0\" alt=\"Level Double-A conformance, W3C WAI Web Content Accessibility Guidelines 2.0\"></a>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"clearboth\"></div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n\n<script language=\"JavaScript\" type=\"text/javascript\">\n$(\".fancybox\").fancybox({\n\twrapCSS    : 'fancybox-custom',\n\tcloseClick : false,\n\tloop:true,\n\topenEffect : 'none',\n\n\thelpers : {\n\t\ttitle : {\n\t\t\ttype : 'inside'\n\t\t},\n\t\toverlay : {closeClick: true}\n\t},\n\n\tafterLoad : function() {\n\t\tvar sp = arguments[0].href;\n\t\tvar tmpStr = this.title.replace(new RegExp('\\\"','gm'),\"&quot;\")\n        \t\t\t\t\t  .replace(new RegExp('\\'','gm'),\"&#39\")  \t\t\t\t\t\t      \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  .replace(new RegExp('>','gm'),'&gt;')\n\t                          .replace(new RegExp('<','gm'),'&lt;')\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t  .replace(new RegExp('\\r\\n','gm'),'<br/>')\n                              .replace(new RegExp('\\n','gm'),'<br/>')\n\t                          .replace(new RegExp('\\r','gm'),'<br/>');\n\t\t\n\t\tthis.title = '<table><tr><td>' + tmpStr + '</td></tr></table>';\n\t}\n});\n\n\n</script>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n", "etag": null, "last_modified": "Tue, 03 Nov 2026 07:00:07 GMT"}